Muhimman iyakoki
Kada a ƙara contributor_admin a production enum har sai an binciki duk functions/policies da ke dogaro da enum da kuma tasirin backward compatibility.
SQL ɗin nan yana da BEGIN/ROLLBACK a matsayin alamar cewa ba executable release ba ne; an bar wasu ƙa'idodin grant/revoke intentionally a matsayin pseudocode/TODO.
Kada a ɗauki selfie a matsayin hujjar liveness ko tabbatar da wanda mutum yake. A buƙaci review na ɗan Adam da consent; idan ana buƙatar liveness, a zaɓi provider/tsari dabam bayan privacy/security review.
Ba a yarda da gallery upload ba. Browser getUserMedia({video: {facingMode: "user"}}) ya nuna preview; a ɗauki frame daga live stream. Wannan ba ya hana virtual camera/spoofing shi kaɗai.
Kada a saka hoton selfie ko raw token a log. Private bucket, short-lived signed URLs, access log, retention/deletion rules, size/type validation da rate limiting dole ne su kasance kafin release.
Mainnet/App ALBUKHR shi kaɗai ke riƙe admin security records. Testnet ba zai sami admin-login mai zaman kansa ba.
Ba a yi GitHub commit, Supabase write/DDL, deployment ko payout/payment activation ba.
